            "action_name": {
              "value": "Funereal Dirge"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(auditory, divine, emotion, fear, mental, necromancy)\n\nThe cairn wight chants a low, haunting melody. Living creatures within 50 feet must attempt a 21 Will save. The cairn wight can't chant a new Funereal Dirge for 1d4 rounds.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature is frightened 1.\n- **Failure:** The creature is frightened 2.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature is frightened 2 and takes a \u20132 status penalty to saving throws against drain life."
            },
